[65.56, "o", "Found the best matches:\r\n\r\n**Zero trust security architecture**\r\n- **Well-Architected Security Skill** (`urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-security`) \u2014 Zero-trust patterns, IAM least-privilege audit, network perimeter design, encryption policy validation. Tier 0, no auth, ready now.\r\n- **GKE Kubernetes Networking Skill** \u2014 network policy hardening (Cilium), useful if your perimeter is containerized.\r\n\r\n**Analytical SQL query optimization**\r\n- **BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines Skill** (`urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines`) \u2014 SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering, window functions. Tier 0, ready now.\r\n- **BigQuery Managed MCP** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`) \u2014 execute queries, dry-run cost estimation, schema inspection. Needs GCP auth (`gcloud auth application-default login`), free tier 1TB/month.\r\n- **AlloyDB MCP / Spanner MCP** \u2014 alternatives if you're on Postgres-columnar or distributed SQL (both Tier 3, need GCP auth).\r\n\r\nAll four skills run offline with no auth; the MCP servers need GCP credentials. Want me to onboard any of the Tier 3 servers, or record a preference to skip cloud-auth tools?\r\n"]
